# Verify Auto-File Gate Allowlist
#
# Gates listed here (one per line, exact gate ID) will auto-file gaps
# when verify-response-loop detects deterministic failure.
#
# All other deterministic failures are logged as observations at
# $SPINE_STATE/verify-observations.ndjson — visible but not gap-filed.
#
# To restore legacy behavior (everything auto-files):
#   export VERIFY_AUTOFILE_ALL=1
#
# To add a gate: append its ID on its own line (e.g. D67)
